items={
'01':("The Pegasus Reports of 2021","In a history seminar you are asked what the company and the Hungarian government said when the Pegasus reports came out in 2021.","Say what the NSO Group and the Hungarian government said, using reported speech.",["Say what the NSO Group stated about who gets the programme","Say what the government said about the secret services"],
 "Az NSO Group azt közölte, hogy a programot csak állami szerveknek adja el. A magyar kormány azt mondta, hogy a titkosszolgálatok a törvényi keretek között működtek.","The NSO Group stated that it sells the programme only to state bodies. The Hungarian government said that the secret services had operated within the legal framework."),
'02':("Authorising Surveillance","In a history seminar you are asked how covert surveillance was authorised and what the European Court of Human Rights found.","Say what the services had to do, and what the Court found in 2016.",["Say what the services had to do before a covert surveillance","Give the year and the finding of the Court"],
 "A szolgálatok kötelesek voltak engedélyt kérni az igazságügyi minisztertől. Az Emberi Jogok Európai Bírósága 2016-ban megállapította, hogy a szabályozás nem nyújtott elegendő garanciát a visszaélések ellen.","The services had to ask the minister of justice for permission. In 2016 the European Court of Human Rights found that the regulation did not offer sufficient guarantees against abuse."),
'03':("Source Protection","In a history seminar you are asked what the journalists and the government said about the effect of the surveillance on sources.","Say, with a hedge, what the organisations thought the surveillance did to sources, and what the government said.",["Say carefully what the surveillance probably did to sources","Say what the government said about the surveillance"],
 "A sajtószabadsággal foglalkozó szervezetek szerint a megfigyelés feltehetőleg elriasztotta a forrásokat. A kormány azt mondta, hogy a megfigyelések törvényesek voltak.","According to the organisations dealing with press freedom, the surveillance probably deterred sources. The government said that the surveillance had been lawful."),
'04':("The Committee Session","In a history seminar you are asked what happened when the opposition called a session of the National Security Committee.","Say what happened to the committee although the opposition had called the session, and when the committee heard the heads of the services.",["Use a concession","Give the month and the year of the hearing"],
 "Annak ellenére, hogy az ellenzék kezdeményezte az ülést, a bizottság nem volt határozatképes. 2022 januárjában a bizottság meghallgatta a titkosszolgálatok vezetőit.","Although the opposition had called the session, the committee did not have a quorum. In January 2022 the committee heard the heads of the secret services."),
'05':("Rules of Surveillance and the Election","In a history seminar you are asked what the human rights organisations proposed and how the election of 2026 ended.","Say what the organisations proposed with a verbal noun, then give the result of the election of 12 April 2026.",["Say what the organisations proposed","Give the result of the election"],
 "A jogvédő szervezetek a titkos megfigyelés bírói engedélyezését javasolták. 2026. április 12-én a Tisza Párt a 199 mandátumból 141-et szerzett.","The human rights organisations proposed the judicial authorisation of covert surveillance. On 12 April 2026 the Tisza Party won 141 of the 199 seats."),
'consolidation':("The Pegasus Case in Summary","At the end of the seminar you are asked to sum up the Pegasus case from 2021 to 2026.","Sum up the case briefly, with years and sources.",["Say what the NSO Group stated","Mention the judgment of 2016","Mention the election of the prime minister in 2026"],
 "Az NSO Group azt közölte, hogy a programot csak állami szerveknek adja el. Az Emberi Jogok Európai Bírósága 2016-ban megállapította, hogy a szabályozás nem nyújtott elegendő garanciát a visszaélések ellen. 2026. május 9-én az Országgyűlés Magyar Pétert választotta miniszterelnökké.","The NSO Group stated that it sells the programme only to state bodies. In 2016 the European Court of Human Rights found that the regulation did not offer sufficient guarantees against abuse. On 9 May 2026 the National Assembly elected Péter Magyar prime minister."),
}
